(
    // Chapter 5 (ticket 0851, docs/story/chapters/ch05.md): the envoy's
    // house on Saltmere's harbor front, past midnight. The house is the
    // tall narrow block in the middle (x 10-17, y 2-8): the street room
    // below (y 6-7) with the street door onto the quay at (13, 8), the
    // stair at (13, 5) up to the room at the top of the stairs (y 3-4),
    // Ragna's floor, and the roof hatch over it at (14, 2). The back door
    // is barred: the house has no other way in. The land side is the flat
    // roofs of the houses round it (y 0-7, low parapets between them),
    // with a stair down to the quay at each end, (1, 8) and (26, 8). The
    // water side is the quay (y 9-11), casks stacked at (5, 10) and
    // (22, 10), and the docks: three piers out over the harbor, the sea
    // steps the wide one in front of the door (x 13-14).
    name: "The Envoy's House",
    legend: {
